    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580/f69f9733-9221-48a9-aada-84ece49d3074/48"
  },
  "reporter": {
    "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
  },
  "labels": [
    "Custom",
    "DesignDependent",
    "PRD-002",
    "PRD-004",
    "Squad-A"
  ],
  "created": "2026-07-01T21:42:53.555+1000",
  "updated": "2026-08-31T20:31:23.905+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13374",
      "body": "User:712020:a070aeb5-3811-46ca-b323-e2272f4cd929 I asked Dani and generally the max number of colours would be 7. Mostly for shoes / bags it’s relevant to have colour selector.\nCC: User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-07T16:15:45.281+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-07T16:15:45.281+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13820",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49  \n\nThis cannot yet be tested: \n\n- New Style Code: Given a shopper clicks a colour swatch, when the selection is registered, then the URL updates to reflect the selected colour with a new style code and a full page reload.\n\nWe need a product attribute for this in BM. \nI’ll create a story for that now. \n\nCC: User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-12T14:43:12.093+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-12T14:43:12.093+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13823",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac  User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 I removed this ac from this ticket: \n\n- New Style Code: Given a shopper clicks a colour swatch, when the selection is registered, then the URL updates to reflect the selected colour with a new style code and a full page reload.\n\nThis requires more build - we will cover this AC in [SFCC-708](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-708)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-12T15:33:06.488+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-12T15:33:06.488+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14048",
      "body": "Pending on the design for more than 4-colour variant and synching Angelo’s PR for static product content.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-26T11:06:37.966+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-26T11:06:37.966+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14080",
      "body": "Hi User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8  User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49 this card is now ready for review\nPR: [https://github.com/ZimmermannAU/zimmermann-pwa/pull/70](https://github.com/ZimmermannAU/zimmermann-pwa/pull/70) \ncc: User:712020:c72e0b63-d931-4077-b54f-c8fdd44a9bfb User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
        "name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
        "email": "jhoan.rose.dela.cruz@accenture.com",
